  message: "Implementing read vs write access_mode requires per-language heuristics. Suggest starting with Python (py_def_use.py already has dataflow extraction) then Rust (rust_def_use.py), then Go. Architectural question: should we distinguish read/write/mutate/pure, or just read/write? Deferring to human review."  # c172
